            </note>
            <note corresp="#d153-f2" n="2" xml:id="d153-f2-content">
                <p>Nahum Goldmann, American Zionist leader, at this time representing the interests
                    of the Provisional Government of Israel at London.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
